# Curio Cards NFT Wrapper Smart Contract Audit Report

## Overview

This folder contains a historical public smart contract audit report completed by Softstack for Curio Cards.

Curio Cards is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a historical NFT and digital collectible smart contract security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: Curio Cards  
Audit type: NFT wrapper smart contract audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

